\
## Observations\
\
### Open Prompts\
- High use of AI and system-based solutions  \
- Focus on optimization  \
\
---\
\
### Constrained Prompts\
- Removal of tech  \
- Shift toward:\
  - social systems  \
  - physical design  \
\
---\
\
### Cross-domain Prompts\
- Use of biological and external metaphors  \
- Example:\
  - mycelium \uc0\u8594  networks  \
  - swarm \uc0\u8594  coordination  \
\
---\
